MesloLGS NF (Regular, Bold, Italic, Bold Italic)

These fonts are the patched MesloLGS NF family distributed by the
powerlevel10k project (https://github.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k-media),
derived from Meslo LG by Andre Berg (https://github.com/andreberg/Meslo-Font),
itself derived from Apple's Menlo font (which derives from Bitstream Vera Sans
Mono / DejaVu Sans Mono), with Nerd Fonts / Powerline glyphs added.

